---
description: Component and screen UI rules — memo, StyleSheet, thin screens
globs: "{src/components,src/app}/**/*.{ts,tsx}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Components & Screens

- Every component: `memo` + `displayName`
- Styles: `StyleSheet.create()` at file bottom — no inline `{}`
- No `useEffect` for derived state — compute or `useMemo`
- Atoms/molecules: no store access
- Organisms: hooks only — never call `engine/` directly
- Screens (`app/`): compose organisms; zero game logic; zero inline styles
- Split if component >120 lines
- `allowFontScaling={false}` on game tile text
- Android: `elevation` via `Platform.select` for shadows
